{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Embark on a path to greatness in a relentless vertical adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb a colossal mountain, overcoming daunting cliffs, perilous ledges, and unexpected obstacles. Test your skills and agility on a challenging route using diverse movement mechanics. Can you complete the ascent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/Falling.gif?t=1749454888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will get:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The joy of success and the pain of mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rewards for active gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple climbing routes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden passages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the climb, you\u2019ll face dangers and have to make tough decisions. Be careful\u2014small mistakes can lead to big falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/MovementOptimized__1_.gif?t=1749454888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the rush of adrenaline as you move swiftly across the rocks, building up your reserves for critical moments. Activate it to slow down time, enabling more precise jumps and increasing your chances of overcoming the toughest challenges. Will you harness this power to reach the peak?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3481630?t=1749454888","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/2a40b7e3887e10d02d46ee558f60f49b488f9420/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749454888","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/ab2454b07ef51f1eed79b57309e2d1c2dbc598a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749454888","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/ab2454b07ef51f1eed79b57309e2d1c2dbc598a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749454888","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3766710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Embark on a path to greatness in a relentless vertical adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Climb a colossal mountain, overcoming daunting cliffs, perilous ledges, and unexpected obstacles. Test your skills and agility on a challenging route using diverse movement mechanics. Can you complete the ascent?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/Falling.gif?t=1749454888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will get:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The joy of success and the pain of mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rewards for active gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple climbing routes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden passages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the climb, you\u2019ll face dangers and have to make tough decisions. Be careful\u2014small mistakes can lead to big falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481630/extras/MovementOptimized__1_.gif?t=1749454888\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the rush of adrenaline as you move swiftly across the rocks, building up your reserves for critical moments. Activate it to slow down time, enabling more precis